#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
TMaster - Tape Master for Commodore 264 series.

Creates master recording files (.raw, .tap, .wav) for multi-load
software products.

Usage:
    tmaster [global args] input_file "recorded_name" [file args]
            [...] output.{raw|tap|wav}

Full specification: tmaster.spec/tmaster.spec.md
Encoding formats:  tmaster.spec/recording-formats.md
TAP container:     tmaster.spec/c16-tap-format.md
"""

